 END) )&#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;   (SUM(IF [Date Filter Is Reporting Date (copy)_1450722053008424962] THEN [dh_deal_value] ELSE 0 END)/MAX(IF [Date Filter Is Reporting Date (copy)_1450722053008424962] THEN [population]/1000 END)&#13;&#10; - SUM(IF [Date Filter 1 Week Before Reporting Date (copy)_1450722053011496970] THEN [dh_deal_value] ELSE 0 END)/MAX(IF [Date Filter 1 Week Before Reporting Date (copy)_1450722053011496970] THEN [population]/1000 END)&#13;&#10;)&#13;&#10;   / (SUM(IF [Date Filter 1 Week Before Reporting Date (copy)_1450722053011496970] THEN [dh_deal_value] ELSE 0 END)/MAX(IF [Date Filter 1 Week Before Reporting Date (copy)_1450722053011496970] THEN [population]/1000 END))&#13;&#10;END * 100, 1))' />
