olean (copy)_378794978137718789] THEN [completed_orders] ELSE 0 END)&#13;&#10;)&#13;&#10;   / (SUM(IF [Start date + 7 Boolean (copy)_378794978137718789] THEN [delayed_20] ELSE 0 END)/SUM(IF [Start date + 7 Boolean (copy)_378794978137718789] THEN [completed_orders] ELSE 0 END))&#13;&#10;END * 100, 1))' />
