              <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF &#13;&#10;(SUM(iif([PMTD (copy)_128141502928715882], [local_shops_orders_total], 0))/SUM(iif([PMTD (copy)_383861552113147904], [local_shops_orders_total], 0)))-1 &gt; 5&#13;&#10;THEN NULL&#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;if    &#13;&#10;SUM(iif([PMTD (copy)_128141502928715882], [local_shops_orders_total], 0)) &lt; SUM(iif([PMTD (copy)_383861552113147904], [local_shops_orders_total], 0))&#13;&#10;then &apos;▼ &apos; &#13;&#10;ELSE &apos;▲ &apos; &#13;&#10;end&#13;&#10;+&#13;&#10;str(round(&#13;&#10;(SUM(iif([PMTD (copy)_128141502928715882], [local_shops_orders_total], 0))/SUM(iif([PMTD (copy)_383861552113147904], [local_shops_orders_total], 0))-1)&#13;&#10;* 100&#13;&#10;,1)&#13;&#10;)&#13;&#10;END' />
